<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 96 0 R
/E (Meetings generate valuable information such as assigned tasks, decisions, responsibilities, and deadlines. However, manually reviewing meeting discussions and converting them into organized action items requires considerable time and may lead to overlooked or incomplete tasks.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
128 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 96 0 R
/E (The system also supports tasktracking and accountability by monitoring action items across multiple meetings. It can identify overdue tasks, repeated or postponed responsibilities, and generate follow-up reminders for pending activities. An interactive dashboard provides a clear view of team workload, task progress, deadlines, and meeting outcomes.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
129 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 96 0 R
/E (The AI Meeting Action-Item Extractor is an intelligent system that uses Artificial Intelligence \(AI\) and Natural Language Processing \(NLP\) to analyze meeting transcripts and automatically identify actionable information. It extracts key details including the task description, assigned person, deadline, priority, current status, and confidence level.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
130 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 96 0 R
/E (Validation mechanisms are incorporated to detect missing task owners, unavailable deadlines, duplicate action items, and low-confidence extractions. By converting unstructured meeting conversations into structured and actionable information, the proposed system helps teams improve task visibility, accountability, and post-meeting productivity.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
